Scenario:

A teacher enters students' marks, but some marks are repeated. Write a Java program using TreeSet to display the unique marks in ascending order.

Program:

import java.util.Scanner;
import java.util.TreeSet;

public class SortedMarks {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        Scanner sc = new Scanner(System.in);
        TreeSet<Integer> marks = new TreeSet<>();

        System.out.print("Enter number of marks: ");
        int n = sc.nextInt();

        for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) {
            System.out.print("Enter mark: ");
            marks.add(sc.nextInt());
        }

        System.out.println("Unique Marks in Ascending Order:");
        System.out.println(marks);

        sc.close();
    }
}

